# Palantir Foundry Python SDK

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.9%2B-blue)](https://www.python.org)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-Apache%202.0-green)](LICENSE)

A production-quality Python client library for the [Palantir Foundry REST API](https://www.palantir.com/docs/foundry/api/). Covers Datasets, Catalog, Ontology (OSDK-style), and Compass file storage — plus a convenient CLI.

---

