## Development

```bash
# Clone and install in editable mode with dev dependencies
git clone https://github.com/palantir/foundry-platform-python
cd foundry-platform-python
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run the test suite (all tests mock the HTTP layer — no real network calls)
pytest tests/ -v

# Run a specific test file
pytest tests/test_datasets.py -v
```

### Project structure

```
palantir_foundry/
  __init__.py       # Public API exports
  client.py         # FoundryClient entry point
  auth.py           # BearerTokenAuth + OAuth2ClientCredentials
  datasets.py       # DatasetsAPI
  catalog.py        # CatalogAPI
  ontology.py       # OntologyAPI
  compass.py        # CompassAPI
  exceptions.py     # FoundryError hierarchy
  cli.py            # click CLI
  _http.py          # Shared requests Session with retry
tests/
  conftest.py       # Shared fixtures
  test_auth.py
  test_datasets.py
  test_catalog.py
  test_ontology.py
  test_compass.py
```

